    "Sandbox_StayWithMe_SpeechDuration": "Speech Duration",
    "Sandbox_StayWithMe_SpeechDuration_tooltip": "How long the companion's overhead speech and in-car lines stay on screen. Normal is 5.25 seconds, Long is 7 seconds, and Very long is 9 seconds. Default: Normal. The same duration applies to the subtitle strip.",
